## **🎯 Context Delivery Decision Matrix**

| Development Activity | Primary Tools | Context Strategy |
|---------------------|---------------|------------------|
| **New Feature** | TaskMaster → Graphiti → Qdrant | Task planning + knowledge search + pattern matching |
| **Bug Fix** | Graphiti → Qdrant → PostgreSQL | Historical issues + similar bugs + current data |
| **Architecture** | neo4j-cypher → Graphiti → MCP_DOCKER | System structure + relationships + infrastructure |
| **API Integration** | GraphQL → Graphiti → Qdrant | Schema introspection + integration patterns + examples |
| **Database Work** | PostgreSQL → neo4j-cypher → Graphiti | Data analysis + schema relationships + architectural context |
| **Deployment** | MCP_DOCKER → TaskMaster → Graphiti | Infrastructure status + deployment tasks + operational knowledge |
| **UI Testing** | Playwright → Qdrant → PostgreSQL | End-to-end automation + test patterns + data validation |
| **Manufacturing Workflows** | Playwright → GraphQL → MQTT → Graphiti | UI automation + real-time data + production patterns |

